{
    "title": "Cars Mod for Minecraft PE 2024",
    "description": "Tired of looking for car mods for Minecraft? For your convenience, we have collected many varieties of cars in one application! Download the Cars Mod for Minecraft PE 2024 app, choose your favorite car mods, install and enjoy driving cool cars in Minecraft\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25!\r\n\r\nWant to move faster on the maps? Or do you want to add your dream car to Minecraft PE? Maybe you and your friends want to arrange races on different maps? In the Cars Mod for Minecraft PE 2024 application you will find various car mods for various needs:\r\n\r\n\u2705 Sports cars;\r\n\u2705 Rescue vehicles (fire, ambulance);\r\n\u2705 Buses;\r\n\u2705 Construction equipment;\r\n\u2705 Mercedes;\r\n\u2705 BMW;\r\n\u2705 Audi;\r\n\u2705 Toyota;\r\n\u2705 Volkswagen;\r\n\u2705 Honda;\r\n\u2705 Datsun;\r\n\u2705 Lamborghini;\r\n\u2705 Ford;\r\n\u2705 Mustang;\r\n\u2705 as well as a wide variety of mods that add motorcycles, helicopters, planes, tanks and even submarines!\r\n\r\nThe realistic look of cars and engine sounds will amaze even experienced players in Minecraft PE. The Cars Mod for Minecraft PE 2024 application allows you not only to find unique mods for cars, but also to customize each car to your taste. Change the color of selected cars and surprise your friends\ud83c\udfae!\r\n\r\nDISCLAIMER: This is an unofficial application for Minecraft Pocket Edition.\r\nThis application is not affiliated in any way with Mojang AB. The Minecraft Name, the Minecraft Brand and the Minecraft Assets are all property of Mojang AB or their respectful owner.\r\nAll rights reserved. In accordance with http://account.mojang.com/documents/brand_guidelines",
    "descriptionHTML": "Tired of looking for car mods for Minecraft? For your convenience, we have collected many varieties of cars in one application! Download the Cars Mod for Minecraft PE 2024 app, choose your favorite car mods, install and enjoy driving cool cars in Minecraft\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25!<br><br>Want to move faster on the maps? Or do you want to add your dream car to Minecraft PE? Maybe you and your friends want to arrange races on different maps? In the Cars Mod for Minecraft PE 2024 application you will find various car mods for various needs:<br><br>\u2705 Sports cars;<br>\u2705 Rescue vehicles (fire, ambulance);<br>\u2705 Buses;<br>\u2705 Construction equipment;<br>\u2705 Mercedes;<br>\u2705 BMW;<br>\u2705 Audi;<br>\u2705 Toyota;<br>\u2705 Volkswagen;<br>\u2705 Honda;<br>\u2705 Datsun;<br>\u2705 Lamborghini;<br>\u2705 Ford;<br>\u2705 Mustang;<br>\u2705 as well as a wide variety of mods that add motorcycles, helicopters, planes, tanks and even submarines!<br><br>The realistic look of cars and engine sounds will amaze even experienced players in Minecraft PE. The Cars Mod for Minecraft PE 2024 application allows you not only to find unique mods for cars, but also to customize each car to your taste. Change the color of selected cars and surprise your friends\ud83c\udfae!<br><br>DISCLAIMER: This is an unofficial application for Minecraft Pocket Edition.<br>This application is not affiliated in any way with Mojang AB. The Minecraft Name, the Minecraft Brand and the Minecraft Assets are all property of Mojang AB or their respectful owner.<br>All rights reserved. In accordance with http://account.mojang.com/documents/brand_guidelines",
